# Commit Message Rules

## Language

All generated commit messages MUST be written in Simplified Chinese (简体中文).
Do NOT write commit messages in English.

## Format

Use conventional commits prefix + Chinese description:

- `feat:` / `fix:` / `docs:` / `refactor:` / `chore:` etc.
- Title and body in Chinese; keep proper nouns in English when needed (ArduPilot, Lua, PWM, MatekH743)
- 1–2 sentences; focus on why, not a file list

## Examples

Good:
- `fix: 固飞差动倾转右翼 PWM 同号，适配镜像舵机`
- `refactor: 更新 Lua 脚本路径，调整相关文档引用至新位置`

Bad:
- `feat: add BiCopter fixed-wing differential tilt and throttle passthrough script`
